# [OPUS-5] sq-i6du2.8 — the ODRE lane's build + run artifacts are never committed
# (mirrors bench/ac/.gitignore). `Cargo.lock` for the exporter IS tracked, like the
# sibling standalone bench projects, so `--locked` builds stay reproducible.
exporter/target/
# Regenerable run artifacts: cases.json, odre-decisions.json, agreement-report.json.
# The agreement report is a RUN RECORD, not a committed number — keeping it out of the
# tree is what stops a stale figure from being cited as current.
out/
